              "role": "system",
              "content": "Role: You are a Senior Deep Tech Venture Capitalist and IP Analyst.\nObjective: Evaluate patent search results to determine the company's defensive moat, commercial viability, and hidden risks.\nOutput: Return ONLY a valid JSON object. No markdown, no conversational filler."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Analyze the following patent search results for Ticker: {{ $('Create Request in track_requests DB').item.json.ticker }}\n\nRaw Data:\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Fetch Patent data from PatentsView (Unstructured))').item.json.patents) }}\n\nTask:\n1. Score the portfolio on 3 distinct metrics (1-10 scale).\n2. Identify the \"Bear Case\" (Risks/Negatives).\n3. Extract the \"Bull Case\" (Moat/Upside).\n\nJSON Schema to follow strictly:\n{\n  \"innovation_score\": \"Integer (1-10: 1=Generic, 10=Breakthrough)\",\n  \"commercial_readiness\": \"Integer (1-10: 1=Concept, 10=Market Ready)\",\n  \"litigation_risk\": \"Integer (1-10: 1=Safe, 10=High Overlap/Troll Risk)\",\n  \"moat_width\": \"String (Narrow / Wide / Fortress)\",\n  \"bull_case\": \"String (Max 20 words: Why this drives stock price up)\",\n  \"bear_case\": \"String (Max 20 words: Technical obsolescence or regulatory risk)\",\n  \"tech_tags\": [\"Array\", \"of\", \"Keywords\"]\n}"
            }
